1
00:00:00,913 --> 00:00:03,883
See?
I never would've thought to do that.

2
00:00:05,284 --> 00:00:07,874
(Sheldon:)Clearly I made a good choice
farming this out to you.

3
00:00:08,087 --> 00:00:10,387
I'm telling you,
Amy hit the boyfriend jackpot.

4
00:00:10,589 --> 00:00:12,019
(Sheldon:)Anyway...

5
00:00:12,358 --> 00:00:14,658
(Sheldon:)...my socks are on.
Let's knock them off.

6
00:00:19,698 --> 00:00:21,958
(Alex:)Well, um, I know
she loves playing the harp...

7
00:00:22,668 --> 00:00:28,728
(Alex:)...so I found this beautiful music box
that plays one of her favorite songs.

8
00:00:31,744 --> 00:00:33,804
(Sheldon:)Now, Amy already has a real harp...

9
00:00:35,247 --> 00:00:37,377
(Sheldon:)...and it can play any song.

10
00:00:38,584 --> 00:00:40,244
(Sheldon:)What are you trying to pull here?

11
00:00:41,787 --> 00:00:44,417
- No, it's just I thought...
- Next.

12
00:00:45,991 --> 00:00:49,121
(Alex:)Okay, um, I know she's a fan
of The Canterbury Tales...

13
00:00:49,294 --> 00:00:50,314
(Leonard:)Mm.

14
00:00:50,496 --> 00:00:56,456
(Alex:)...so I found this cool map that illustrates
the characters' journey through England.

15
00:00:56,635 --> 00:00:58,935
(Alex:)We could put it in a really nice frame.

16
00:00:59,772 --> 00:01:06,022
(Sheldon:)But she's got Google Maps on her phone.

